independence.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,680
So Britain looked at the far side of

7
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,960
the world and thought perfect.

8
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:19,690
In 1787, 11 ships called the first fleet

9
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:24,410
set sail carrying roughly 1500 people around 750

10
